  "title": "ELF: Add heuristics over HTTP",
  "description": "ELF has a four byte magic number, not all printable ASCII\n(the first is a 0x7F/DEL), which should be sufficient for a\nheuristic.\n\nThe capture file in #20406 is an example of an ELF file with the\nwrong Content-Type. (The new \"try heuristic subdissectors first\"\npreference for HTTP would also need to be enabled.)",
